<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Can I cancel an order?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Once confirmed, an order is taken into our system and may quickly move into processing with partners or suppliers.</p>
    <p>It generally cannot be cancelled once processing has started — even if not yet shipped.</p>
    <p>Some items are sourced specifically after confirmation. Costs are incurred quickly to secure the ordered item.</p>
    <p>We do not refund cancellation requests after order confirmation.</p>
    <p>To change your order, contact us quickly — we may offer store credit depending on progress.</p>
    <p>Contact: <a href="{{ contact_url }}">contact@resell-lausanne.ch</a>.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Can I return an item?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Voluntary returns apply to <strong>sneakers / footwear only</strong>, as exchange or store credit, if returned in original condition.</p>
    <p><strong>Apparel and accessories</strong> are excluded from voluntary returns, except for our error or proven defect.</p>
    <p>Deadline: <strong>14 calendar days</strong> after receipt, request submitted <strong>before</strong> shipping back.</p>
    <p>Conditions: unworn, complete box/labels/accessories, Resell seal intact, no signs of use.</p>
    <p><strong>Excluded from voluntary returns</strong> (except error/defect): watches, jewellery, collectibles, non-sneaker products, items above <strong>CHF&nbsp;650.–</strong>, <strong>older pairs (2016 or earlier)</strong> for age-related issues or faults after wear, and any item purchased on <strong>sale</strong>, <strong>Soldes 48h</strong>, clearance, archive or at a <strong>promotional price</strong> (compare-at / strikethrough price).</p>
    <p><strong>Prior approval required</strong> — return address sent by email after acceptance.</p>
    <p>Start a <a href="{{ faq_return_url }}">return request</a>.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Which products cannot be returned?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>No voluntary return for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>apparel, accessories and streetwear;</li>
      <li>watches, jewellery, collectibles and non-sneaker items;</li>
      <li>any product purchased above <strong>CHF&nbsp;650.–</strong>;</li>
      <li>older pairs (<strong>2016 or earlier</strong>): age-related material issues or faults that appear after wear;</li>
      <li>any item purchased on <strong>sale</strong>, <strong>Soldes 48h</strong>, clearance, archive or at a <strong>promotional price</strong> (compare-at / strikethrough price).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>These exclusions apply to voluntary returns, size exchanges and store credit. No convenience refund on sale or promotional purchases.</p>
    <p>Our error or proven defect: contact us with photos at <a href="{{ contact_url }}">contact@resell-lausanne.ch</a>.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Are older pairs (2016 or earlier) refundable?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p><strong>No</strong> for age-related material issues (midsole, glue, foam) or faults that appear after wear — even if the pair was new / deadstock at purchase.</p>
    <p>On older pairs, materials weaken naturally over time. Like specialised marketplaces (e.g. GOAT vintage), these pairs may not be suitable for regular wear. An info notice appears in the product description when applicable.</p>
    <p>A defect already present on delivery and reported immediately (with photos) is still handled under our usual terms.</p>
    <p>Contact: <a href="{{ contact_url }}">contact@resell-lausanne.ch</a>.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Are sale and promotional items eligible for return?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p><strong>No.</strong> Items sold on sale, Soldes 48h, clearance or archive, or at a promotional price (compare-at / strikethrough price), are not eligible for voluntary returns, exchanges or store credit.</p>
    <p>These offers cover limited stock, often with 48h delivery from our warehouse. The reduced price is final for convenience returns (wrong size, change of mind).</p>
    <p>Only a proven defect or our error may give rise to a remedy under applicable law.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>How does store credit work?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>No refund to the original payment method for voluntary returns.</p>
    <p>Exchange or store credit: <strong>10%</strong> fee.</p>
    <p>Example: CHF 200 purchase → CHF 180 credit or applied to an exchange.</p>
    <p>Orders paid with store credit remain treated as store credit on accepted return.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>What are return fees?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p><strong>10%</strong> for size/model exchange or store credit.</p>
    <p>Original shipping, return shipping and return label paid by customer, except our error or defect.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Can I exchange my size?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Direct exchange if size available (<strong>10%</strong> fee), otherwise store credit (<strong>10%</strong> fee).</p>
    <p>Contact <a href="{{ contact_url }}">contact@resell-lausanne.ch</a> or use the <a href="{{ faq_return_url }}">return request</a> before shipping.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<details class="rl-faq-page__item">
  <summary>Why no refund to original payment method?</summary>
  <div class="rl-faq-page__answer">
    <p>Most items are sourced per order. Convenience returns tie up cost and stock — hence exchange or store credit instead of full refund.</p>
    <p>Our error or proven defect: we apply mandatory solutions, including refund where required.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href="{{ contact_url }}">contact@resell-lausanne.ch</a>.</p>
  </div>
</details>
